  + [T02 stale admission] reacquire immediately and refuse semantic or canonical mismatch
  + [T03 executable swap] rehash exact nonlink file before and after child execution
  + [T04 schema substitution] bind standard experimental and selected definition identities plus exact request grammar
  + [T05 profile overclaim] require list membership and physical allowed denied-read denied-write outcomes
  + [T06 rule precedence drift] bind root minimal candidate nested deny ordering and exact serialized override
  + [T07 environment leakage] close environment and reject credentials proxies helpers hooks editors pagers provider keys and remote aliases
  + [T08 path alias escape] canonicalize and reject links reparses overlap equality containment inversion Git common-directory or principal-root contact
  + [T09 write-prevention failure] preserve created or changed canary set may_have_mutated true quarantine and no cleanup
  + [T10 hidden mutation] compare complete bounded pre-post direct inventory rather than only named canaries
  + [T11 transcript laundering] enforce ids order exact methods exact outputs admitted notifications and terminal closure
  + [T12 output disclosure] refuse denied sentinel bytes stdout leakage unexpected stderr or oversized output
  + [T13 child escape] account direct child descendants interruption termination reap and late output
  + [T14 timeout ambiguity] timeout after launch cannot claim nonmutation or reusable scratch
  + [T15 service-network overclaim] record zero provider/model requests while retaining App Server service-network prevention as unproved
  + [T16 capability inflation] exact four-grant eighteen-denial partition and no metadata-to-carrier decoding
  + [T17 receipt laundering] rehash all raw artifacts and require deterministic self-digest after every authority predicate
  + [T18 verifier side effect] static surface forbids process environment network Git write output path cleanup recovery provider model MCP and clock
  + [T19 foreign capture] stage from an exact owned inventory and assert AGENTS Minecraft Zeta D-drive and unrelated paths remain excluded
  + [T20 gate substitution] recursive evidence format or remote equality never substitutes for debug release or executable replay

& [FailureConsequence]
  + before physical contact refuse with may_have_mutated false and quarantine false
  + after observation begins success may claim may_have_mutated false only after denied-write absence stable inventory and child quiescence
  + every ambiguous or positive mutation signal sets may_have_mutated true or unknown quarantine true reusable false and cleanup false

& [Residual]
  + beta permission-profile stability and native Windows execution policy remain external host risks
  + provider-backed B2 behavior remains unavailable and unmeasured
  + durable production workspace isolation review signing persistence and activation remain later stages

& [Decision]
  + threats are structurally coverable without weakening the source or contacting a provider
